 "note": "nt-print v1.34 + nt-scan v1.5 (purana server ab counter: NT-PRINT C:\\nt-print mein; SQL setting na ho to sql-config nahi — process.exit band; dheema scanner bhi pakra jata hai: 6+ harf / 5+ hindse har fasla <= 90 ms). Pichhla: doctor v3.13 + nabz.js v1.0 (🚨 dukan ki nabz: har 2 min pcBeat/<chaabi> - malik ke phone ka MacroDroid alarm; sirf server, sirf haal ki likhai). Pichhla: rate-change v1.2 (W / R dukan ke ItemBranchRate se - item screen jaisa; har 10 s CHECKSUM = rate badla to foran list). Pichhla: pos-khata-sync x (Daily Sab print: closing cash hata - GALLE MEIN HONA CHAHIYE) + raat-report v2.5 (WhatsApp Daily Sale: Aaj ka change + Galle mein hona, closing / farq nahi). Pichhla: pc-names v1.1 (counter ka naam = PC ka apna naam NT-PRINT se, 🔗 pcAlias, chFind) + bill-clip v2.7 (NVR tak rasta nahi = ruko + network jaanch) + live-cam v1.6 + pos-sales-dekho v2.14 + gate-pass v1.4 + raat-report v2.4 + nt-print v1.33 (PC scripts khula = har 20 s report). Pichhla: pos-khata-sync w6: ⚖️ Ek voucher (@balance) = SIRF EK JV — transfer ab alag voucher se nahi; app ka ✕ Rok do (status stop). Pichhla: nt-posui v1.15: POS screen watcher ki memory had (600 MB) — upar = 2 s mein naya (malik ke PC par 4.5 GB tha). Pichhla: a4-print v1.7 + wa-parchi v2.37: WhatsApp par A4 ka ASAL nateeja (chhap gayi / nahi + wajah), yaad wala printer foran, spooler se kam sawal. Pichhla: pc-names.js v1.0 (nayi) + bill-clip v2.6 + live-cam v1.5 + pos-sales-dekho v2.13 + gate-pass v1.3 + raat-report v2.3: counter ka naam NT-PRINT ki setting (printPCs) se, purane naam ka camera channel bhi chalta. Pichhla: raat-report v2.2 + kh-wa v1.10: reports menu 8 = maal khatam hone wala (sirf maangne par). Pichhla: hz-wa v1.1 (hazri number se) + kh-wa v1.9 (reports sab ko, nafa sirf malik, sab codes) + raat-report v2.1 + larka-stats v3 (godam ka maal larke ki sale mein nahi) + wa-out v1.25. Pichhla: raat-report v2.0: subah ki udhaar report (N din se wasooli nahi) malik ke WhatsApp par. Pichhla: doctor v3.2: server PC ka naam (blueAccess/serverPc, default DESKTOP-Q1SLV77) - doosre naam wala PC scripts band rakhe. Pichhla: hz-wa v1.0 (nayi file) + wa-out v1.22: larkon ki bahar jane ki request WhatsApp se. Pichhla: 14 Nov: raat-report v1.9 (POS Sale.COGS khana nahi = andaza, aaj ki report, app ko haal) + item-report v1.9 (nafa COGS ke baghair). Pichhla: wa-parchi v2.33: gahak ka number alag paigham mein bhi + 0371… jaise naye number. Pichhla: raat-report v1.8: report na bane / atak jaye to malik ko WhatsApp par wajah. Pichhla: 👥 raat-report v1.7 + kh-wa v1.7 (malik 14 Nov: hazri app jor do, larkon ki report WhatsApp par): hazriIn -> subah 10 + shaam ki reports ke saath + 'hazri' likhne par; wa-out v1.21 / wa-parchi v2.32 sirf version. Pichhla: 👤 wa-parchi v2.31 + wa-out v1.20 (malik 14 Nov, screenshot: number reply kiya phir bhi \"gahak? (number nahi)\" / bill nahi gaya): gahak ka number ab har parchi wale paigham ke reply se lagta hai (⚠️ Print auto / ✅ Parchi Mubeen ko gayi / ⏰ / ▶️ — waOut pp) + \"Print auto 0344…\" reply bhi; Bu",
